OL,3,GNEWSA'As soon as I work, I get         
OL,4,Apenalised - I fear I will never own my 
OL,5,Aown home'                              
OL,7,FHis case was highlighted in Parliament 
OL,8,Fby MP Ian Sollom. Prime Minister Andy  
OL,9,FBurnham called the situation "unfair"  
OL,10,Fand asked for it to be looked into.    
